degree(DiffAlgElement) -- degree of a differential form or a vector field
*************************************************************************

  * Function: *note degree: (Macaulay2Doc)degree,
  * Usage: 
        degree e
  * Inputs:
      * e, an instance of the type *note DiffAlgElement: DiffAlgElement,, a
        differential form or vector field
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, If e is a vector field it returns
        {n,d}; if e is a differential form it returns {n,r,d}.

Description
===========

This function returns the degree of a homogeneous differential form or vector
field.

  * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, is the number of variables minus
    one
  * r, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, is the degree of the differential
    form or empty if e is a vector field
  * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, is the degree of the polynomial
    coefficients


In the following example we compute the degree of a differential form and a
vector field.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : w = newForm(2,1,3,"a")                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|         3      2          2       3      2                     2           2|
|o1 = (a x  + a x x  + a x x  + a  x  + a x x  + a  x x x  + a  x x  + a  x x |
|       0 0    3 0 1    9 0 1    18 1    6 0 2    12 0 1 2    21 1 2    15 0 2|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|             2       3           3      2           2       3      2         |
|     + a  x x  + a  x )dx  + (a x  + a x x  + a  x x  + a  x  + a x x  +     |
|        24 1 2    27 2   0     1 0    4 0 1    10 0 1    19 1    7 0 2       |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                     2           2         2       3           3      2      |
|     a  x x x  + a  x x  + a  x x  + a  x x  + a  x )dx  + (a x  + a x x  +  |
|      13 0 1 2    22 1 2    16 0 2    25 1 2    28 2   1     2 0    5 0 1    |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|           2       3      2                     2           2         2      |
|     a  x x  + a  x  + a x x  + a  x x x  + a  x x  + a  x x  + a  x x  +    |
|      11 0 1    20 1    8 0 2    14 0 1 2    23 1 2    17 0 2    26 1 2      |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         3                                                                   |
|     a  x )dx                                                                |
|      29 2   2                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : DiffAlgForm                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : degree(w)                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 = {2, 1, 3}                                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : X = newField(2,2,"b")                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|         2               2                          2           2            |
|o3 = (b x  + b x x  + b x  + b x x  + b  x x  + b  x )ax  + (b x  + b x x  + |
|       0 0    3 0 1    9 1    6 0 2    12 1 2    15 2   0     1 0    4 0 1   |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|         2                          2           2                2           |
|     b  x  + b x x  + b  x x  + b  x )ax  + (b x  + b x x  + b  x  + b x x  +|
|      10 1    7 0 2    13 1 2    16 2   1     2 0    5 0 1    11 1    8 0 2  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                   2                                                         |
|     b  x x  + b  x )ax                                                      |
|      14 1 2    17 2   2                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : DiffAlgField                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : degree X                                                                |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {2, 2}                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

If the *note DiffAlgElement: DiffAlgElement, is non-homogeneous the function
returns the highest degrees {n,r,d} of each homogeneous component in the given
expression. For example, if the degree of w is {2,1,3}, then degree(w + (diff
w)) returns, {2,2,3}

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note degree(DiffAlgElement): degree_lpDiffAlgElement_rp, -- degree of a
    differential form or a vector field
