DiffAlgField _ DiffAlgForm -- contraction of a differential form with respect to a vector field
***********************************************************************************************

  * Operator: *note _: (Macaulay2Doc)_us,
  * Usage: 
        X _ w
  * Inputs:
      * X, an instance of the type *note DiffAlgField: DiffAlgField,, a vector
        field
      * w, an instance of the type *note DiffAlgForm: DiffAlgForm,, a
        differential form
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note DiffAlgForm: DiffAlgForm,, the
        contraction of w with respect to X

Description
===========

Given a vector field X and a differential form w, this function returns the
contraction of w with respect to X. The function can be called as X _ w  or as
w _ X.



In this example we compute the contraction of a simple differential form and a
vector field.

+-------------------------------+
|i1 : w = newForm("dx_0 * dx_1")|
|                               |
|o1 = dx dx                     |
|       0  1                    |
|                               |
|o1 : DiffAlgForm               |
+-------------------------------+
|i2 : Y = newField("ax_0")      |
|                               |
|o2 = ax                        |
|       0                       |
|                               |
|o2 : DiffAlgField              |
+-------------------------------+
|i3 : Y _ w                     |
|                               |
|o3 = dx                        |
|       1                       |
|                               |
|o3 : DiffAlgForm               |
+-------------------------------+

