homogenize(DiffAlgElement) -- homogenize a differential form or vector field
****************************************************************************

  * Function: *note homogenize: (Macaulay2Doc)homogenize,
  * Usage: 
        homogenize e
  * Inputs:
      * e, an instance of the type *note DiffAlgElement: DiffAlgElement,, a
        form or a vector field
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note DiffAlgElement: DiffAlgElement,, the
        homogenization of e with respect to a new variable. The resulting form
        or vector field is homogeneous.

Description
===========

+-----------------------------------------+
|i1 : w = newForm("2*x_0*dx_0+x_1^2*dx_1")|
|                                         |
|               2                         |
|o1 = 2x dx  + x dx                       |
|       0  0    1  1                      |
|                                         |
|o1 : DiffAlgForm                         |
+-----------------------------------------+
|i2 : homogenize w                        |
|                                         |
|                 2                       |
|o2 = 2x x dx  + x dx                     |
|       0 2  0    1  1                    |
|                                         |
|o2 : DiffAlgForm                         |
+-----------------------------------------+
+---------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : homogenize newField ("ax_0+x_1*ax_2+a*ax_1")  |
|                                                   |
|o3 = x ax  + a*x ax  + x ax                        |
|      3  0      3  1    1  2                       |
|                                                   |
|o3 : DiffAlgField                                  |
+---------------------------------------------------+

Caveat
======

The homogenization process of a form adds one variable to the given element.

See also
========

  * *note projectivize: projectivize, -- projectivize a differential form or
    vector field
  * *note isHomogeneous: (Macaulay2Doc)isHomogeneous, -- whether something is
    homogeneous (graded)

Ways to use this method:
========================

  * *note homogenize(DiffAlgElement): homogenize_lpDiffAlgElement_rp, --
    homogenize a differential form or vector field
