singularIdeal -- ideal generated by the polynomial coefficients of a differential form or vector field
******************************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        singularIdeal(e)
  * Inputs:
      * e, an instance of the type *note DiffAlgElement: DiffAlgElement,, a
        differential form or vector field
