|                                                                            |
|      3     2         2     3     2                  2         2      2    3|
|o7 = x  + 6x x  + 3x x  - 4x  + 5x x  - 10x x x  + 6x x  + 3x x  - x x  + x |
|      0     0 1     0 1     1     0 2      0 1 2     1 2     0 2    1 2    2|
|                                                                            |
|      QQ[i]                                                                 |
|o7 : ------[][x ..x ]                                                       |
|      2        0   2                                                        |
|     i  + 1                                                                 |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

